WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:22.097
Riley: Ben! Psst!

2
00:00:22.098 --> 00:00:24.960
Ben: Riley! Shh!

3
00:00:24.961 --> 00:00:29.622
Riley: But I have to tell you something!

4
00:00:29.623 --> 00:00:31.490
Ben: What?

5
00:00:31.491 --> 00:00:34.501
Riley: It's about my dog Snooks.

6
00:00:34.502 --> 00:00:37.943
Ben: Snooks is all you ever talk about.

7
00:00:37.944 --> 00:00:40.431
Riley: But this is big news.

8
00:00:40.432 --> 00:00:43.496
I taught Snooks a new trick!

9
00:00:43.497 --> 00:00:48.540
Mrs. Bell: Riley and Ben, no talking please!

10
00:00:48.541 --> 00:00:50.759
Riley: I'm sorry, Mrs. Bell.

11
00:00:50.760 --> 00:00:55.225
I just wanted to tell Ben about Snooks.

12
00:00:55.226 --> 00:00:58.055
Mrs. Bell: What does that have to do with school?

13
00:00:58.056 --> 00:01:03.993
Riley: Well . . . I'm teaching Snooks.

14
00:01:03.994 --> 00:01:11.727
Teaching him tricks!

15
00:01:11.728 --> 00:01:16.397
Mrs. Bell: That's nice. But you and Ben broke the no-talking rule.

16
00:01:16.398 --> 00:01:31.674
Mrs. Bell: That means no recess today!

17
00:01:31.675 --> 00:01:33.946
Riley: I'm sorry, Ben.

18
00:01:33.947 --> 00:01:36.045
I got you into trouble.

19
00:01:36.046 --> 00:01:41.125
Ben: Again! What did you teach Snooks anyway?

20
00:01:41.126 --> 00:01:44.748
Riley: I taught him how to roll over!

21
00:01:44.749 --> 00:01:49.626
Ben: Wow! I wish I could teach my turtle, Speedy, a trick.

22
00:01:49.627 --> 00:01:57.407
Riley: Maybe I could help you.

23
00:01:57.408 --> 00:02:00.802
Riley: That was a pretty fun recess.

24
00:02:00.803 --> 00:02:05.558
Ben: Yeah! Too bad we can't talk about our pets all day.

25
00:02:05.559 --> 00:02:09.218
Riley: And teach them tricks together.

26
00:02:09.219 --> 00:02:12.644
Riley: I have an idea!

27
00:02:12.645 --> 00:02:16.525
There's no time for our pets during school.

28
00:02:16.526 --> 00:02:20.088
Riley: So let's meet with our pets after school.

29
00:02:20.089 --> 00:02:23.160
Ben: What?

30
00:02:23.161 --> 00:02:31.155
Riley: Let's form a club—a pet lovers club!
